# Project Conventions

- **Styles**: All CSS must be defined in `style.css`. Do not use inline styles or `<style>` blocks in HTML.
- **Scripts**: All JavaScript must be in `scripts.js`. Do not use inline scripts or `<script>` blocks with code in HTML; only reference `scripts.js` via a `<script src="scripts.js">` tag.
